らして盛大に失禁(尿は透明無色)\n・画像②の表情に涙、鼻水、涎を描写\n・互いをオカズにイく台詞、情けない喘ぎ声、吐息、痙攣音、潮吹き音、画像③の様な花やキラキラのエフェクトを描写\n(気持ちよく昇天している様なイメージ)\n\n①https://www.dropbox.com/s/ny3uc9kvtuvpchv/_20201216_234838.JPG?dl=0\n②https://www.dropbox.com/s/t9wai8jixjvnp7l/_20201216_234806.JPG?dl=0\n③https://www.dropbox.com/s/y36d77fu3fxiykx/_20201217_002941.JPG?dl=0", "nc": 170, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@55655mika/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 833556, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5d4ed389/requests/176975_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17dff31e5d5c64f07c76112c289147d5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5d4ed389/requests/176975_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17dff31e5d5c64f07c76112c289147d5, https://si.imgix.net/5d4ed389/requests/176975_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e427db5a581c535b491b0d1f68bba680 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5d4ed389/requests/176975_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76f96274e243de38c75fc8505d999e4d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": true, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5d4ed389/requests/176975_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bda10c0a39b199c808d30ca52fd89742", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5d4ed389/requests/176975_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bda10c0a39b199c808d30ca52fd89742, https://si.imgix.net/5d4ed389/requests/176975_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=15411645b1751613e78fa85a1137a974 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5d4ed389/requests/176975_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b7dd8d552c695a338c742950c3af9e3b 3x"}, "body": "タイトル 村人とジャックの変態女装オナニー\n\n・2人ともURL①の衣装を着用\n(2人の白ズボンは白の女児パンツに変更)\n(2人のリュックは省略し、蝶々の羽のみ描写)\n(ジャックも村人と同じパフ袖に変更)\n・URL②の様にボタンが腕などで隠れない様な姿勢で、一緒にパンツ越しにシコシコ自慰\n・全身で激しく痙攣絶頂、パンツ越しに勢いよくいっぱい射精し床にぶちまける\n(射精の量や勢いは穿いてない時と同じくらい)\n・モニカ、リリィをオカズにイく台詞、情けない喘ぎ声、吐息、痙攣音、射精音を描写\n(ポスターの描写は省略して大丈夫です)\n・URL②の表情に、涙とよだれと鼻水を描写\n\n初めまして、細かい上にエグい内容ですみません！\nもし気が向かれましたら、よろしくお願い致します…！\n\n①https://www.dropbox.com/s/jvf0hgtw4s7srfe/IMG_20201123_180817.jpg?dl=0\n②https://www.dropbox.com/s/smzduwfl0bwgi8z/IMG_20201123_180823.jpg?dl=0", "nc": 170, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 212931, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "Bee/あやかわ", "screen_name": "b_ayakawa", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/809285135774269440/nTWAXdFM.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/809282222662381568/1674708657/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 177}, {"id": 428927, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "鍵山りゅうた☃️🧪skeb受付中", "screen_name": "RofS_ryuta", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2009258593556860928/pNOhSXQ0.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/636321870/1665321286/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 15, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 176}, {"id": 1189730, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "セロリー", "screen_name": "tirofinire"